qnapi (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.3.0 of the maintained fork at
    https://github.com/MikoWhy91/qnapi
  * OpenSubtitles engine uses the opensubtitles.com REST API (API key required)
  * Build with CMake and Qt 6; binary package Depends on qt6-qpa-plugins

